{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788217707107,"sessionID":"ses_fa5eb6461ffeMsD7uLAy4rsiUF","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-a72dfb905cf4fabe","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -n \"Q2\\b\\|q2-\\|Q3\\b\\|q3-\\|jq-expressiveness\" plans/questions.md | head"},"output":"22:| [Q2](#q2-binary-operators-over-two-multi-valued-expressions-cartesian-zip-or-explicit) | Binary operators over two multi-valued expressions: cartesian, zip, or explicit? | OPEN |\n23:| [Q3](#q3-what-symbol-replaces--for-the-record-forming-update) | What symbol replaces `=` for the record-forming update? | LEANING, blocked on Q2 |\n29:| [Q9](#q9-are-vectors-multidimensional-with--as-projection) | Are vectors multidimensional, with `[]` as projection? | OPEN, may merge with Q2 |\n73:### Q2. Binary operators over two multi-valued expressions: cartesian, zip, or explicit?\n81:half of Q2 in favor of concatenation over cartesian or zip. The named builtin this superseded,\n94:### Q3. What symbol replaces `=` for the record-forming update?\n","metadata":{"output":"22:| [Q2](#q2-binary-operators-over-two-multi-valued-expressions-cartesian-zip-or-explicit) | Binary operators over two multi-valued expressions: cartesian, zip, or explicit? | OPEN |\n23:| [Q3](#q3-what-symbol-replaces--for-the-record-forming-update) | What symbol replaces `=` for the record-forming update? | LEANING, blocked on Q2 |\n29:| [Q9](#q9-are-vectors-multidimensional-with--as-projection) | Are vectors multidimensional, with `[]` as projection? | OPEN, may merge with Q2 |\n73:### Q2. Binary operators over two multi-valued expressions: cartesian, zip, or explicit?\n81:half of Q2 in favor of concatenation over cartesian or zip. The named builtin this superseded,\n94:### Q3. What symbol replaces `=` for the record-forming update?\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -n \"Q2\\b\\|q2-\\|Q3\\b\\|q3-\\|jq-expressiveness\" plans/questions.md | head","time":{"start":1788217707100,"end":178821