nsors (draft-split)\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  soft: [benchmark-goals]","truncated":true,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-169/plans/board.yaml","text":"- id: binary-op-multiplicity-design\n  title: Grill binary operators over multi-valued operands (cartesian, zip, or explicit) and the record-forming update's spelling -- Q2/Q3 (draft-split)\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  prio: 3\n  status: todo\n\n- id: search-and-fold-design\n  title: Grill the search vocabulary (choice, cut, .., ordering) and the applicative fold block -- unratified draft sections (draft-split)\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  soft: [first-search-cut]\n  prio: 4\n  status: todo\n\n- id: offload-boundary-design\n  title: Grill the offload/vectorization thesis -- kernel admissibility, batch invariance, parallel basis, tensors (draft-split)\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  soft: [benchmark-goals]","lineStart":274,"lineEnd":293,"totalLines":310,"truncated":true}},"title":"plans/board.yaml","time":{"start":1788217714995,"end":1788217715008}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The row jq-expressiveness-under-zip-or-explicit-research isn't in board.yaml. It may be that the board row was expected but isn't present. Let me look at the binary-op-multiplicity-design row to understand the exact question.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05a14e5ed001MygtVcksqwxQmC","sessionID":"ses_fa5eb6461ffeMsD7uLAy4rsiUF","messageID":"msg_05a14e08f001RTOC48ItVhRLXh"}}
